<h1>hash table delete</h1>
<p>
(algorithm)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
If the <a href="hashtab.html"><em>hash table</em></a> uses <a href="chaining.html"><em>chaining</em></a>, use the chaining data structure delete.  If it uses <a href="openAddressing.html"><em>open addressing</em></a>, mark the item "deleted" for future reuse.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="cuckooHashing.html"><em>cuckoo hashing</em></a>.
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

<hr>

